  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Local Aid Coordination Secretariat 2023-2026</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to the Prime Minister Office regarding the Local Aid Coordination Secretariat (LACS)  for the period 2023-2026. LACS supports local aid coordination structures in Palestine in providing coherent technical assistance and financial support to the Palestinian people based on national priorities and in line with the OECD-DAC Paris Declaration on Aid Effectiveness of 2005.</narrative>
  </description>
